# a format 34 project and its presets (format 17), from before the delay's 1/4D (format 35: the TIME knob's 122..127,
# 1/4 then, now 1/4D; project.c dl_old): saved by that build, for the migration's test (tests/scenarios/migrate.xy).
# Track 2's slot 2 a delay at 127 with a lock at 125 on step 5, saved as user preset U1; track 3's delay at 110 (1/8D:
# kept); FX I's delay at 124; Master FX a delay at 123.
# Run by a format 34 build (354044e): its loom_host tests/fixtures/make_v34.xy
wait 300
bpm 100
pat 2 1 16 1 50 0
notes 2 1 1 0.5 100 C3
notes 2 1 5 0.5 100 E3
param 2 itype 16
param 2 i1 127
param 2 s2mix 100
lock 2 1 5 i1 125
param 3 itype 16
param 3 i1 110
param 11 camt 124
mst color delay
mst camount 123
mst cmix 64
wait 40
usersave 2 1
projsave 1 v34_test
storesave tests/fixtures/store_v34.bin
